    {
      "title": "How It Works",
      "content": "The <strong>vision-language module (System 2)</strong> interprets the environment through vision and language instructions, while the <strong>diffusion transformer module (System 1)</strong> generates motor actions in real-time. Both modules are <strong>tightly coupled and jointly trained end-to-end</strong>.",
